9.9498291015625, 12507.0791015625], "widgets_values": ["，故事板时长为", "", "秒.", ","], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text1"}, "name": "text1", "label": "text1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "text2"}, "name": "text2", "link": 632, "label": "text2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本_2"}, {"widget": {"name": "text3"}, "name": "text3", "label": "text3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本_3"}, {"widget": {"name": "delimiter"}, "name": "delimiter", "label": "delimiter", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "分隔符"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 425, "type": "ttN concat", "properties": {"ttNnodeVersion": "1.0.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ttN concat"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [632], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [310.515869140625, 93.38060760498047], "pos": [-1070.400146484375, 12453.3701171875], "widgets_values": ["15"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 413, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [979.7152709960938, 1250.6851806640625], "pos": [1518.3260498046875, 11528.8759765625], "widgets_values": ["你好！我是你的首席导演兼摄影指导。基于你提供的参考图像，我为你策划并制作了这份**15秒、9镜头**的高规格商业级故事板。\n\n**核心概念：** 捕捉“都市休闲时刻”的松弛感与自信。通过从环境广角到面部特写的层层递进，展现女主在时尚店铺或休闲角落中，享受自拍时光的愉悦与时尚态度。\n\n---\n\n### A) 场景解析 (Scene Breakdown)\n\n*   **主体 (Subjects):**\n    *   **女主角 (A):** 年轻女性，黑色长直发，五官精致，笑容灿烂自信。\n    *   **服饰:** 白色做旧印花T恤（领口有褶皱细节），米色竖条纹衬衫随意搭在腿上，白色堆堆袜，黑色乐福鞋。\n    *   **道具:** 豹纹大托特包（斜挎），金色大圆环耳环。\n*   **环境 (Environment):** 室内休闲区/店铺。左侧是红砖墙，右侧是白色护墙板，地面深色木质。背景墙上挂有一排展示不同穿搭的照片。\n*   **光影 (Lighting & Grade):** 柔和的漫射光，模拟自然日光。色温偏暖，低对比度，营造出胶片感的清新与高级感。\n\n---\n\n### B) 主题与故事 (Theme & Story)\n\n*   **主题:** 自信瞬间 (Confident Moment) —— 在属于自己的时刻，定格最美的姿态。\n*   **情感弧线 (Emotional Arc):**\n    1.  **Setup (铺垫):** 环境入画，展现慵懒坐姿。\n    2.  **Build (建立):** 视线聚焦，笑容逐渐绽放。\n    3.  **Turn (转折):** 调整道具，展现时尚品味。\n    4.  **Payoff (高潮):** 眼神直视镜头，定格完美表情。\n*   **视觉锚点 (Visual Anchors):** 红砖墙纹理、豹纹包、白色T恤、柔和的自然光、背景挂画。\n\n---\n\n### C) 电影摄影方案 (Cinematic Approach)\n\n*   **镜头策略:** 采用**由远及近 (Zoom In / Dolly In)** 的视觉逻辑。从展示人物与环境的广角镜头开始，逐渐压缩空间，最终聚焦于人物面部表情，增强情绪的感染力。\n*   **镜头语言:**\n    *   **镜头焦段:** 24mm - 85mm 变焦组合。广角用于环境，50mm/85mm用于特写。\n    *   **景深:** 广角端景深稍深，特写端使用极浅景深（Bokeh）以突出眼神和皮肤质感。\n    *   **构图:** 利用左侧砖墙形成引导线，将视线引向人物。\n*   **色彩:** 保持原图的胶片质感，略微提升暖色调，强调砖墙的复古感与人物肌肤的通透感。\n\n---\n\n### D) 关键帧列表 (Keyframes List)\n*总时长: 15秒 | 镜头数: 9个*\n\n#### [KF01 | 2.0s | ELS (Extreme Long Shot) / 环境广角]\n*   **画面:** 左侧红砖墙占据画面左侧三分之一，右侧白色墙面及背景挂画清晰。女主坐在黑色长凳上，双腿蜷缩，姿态放松。镜头极宽，展示空间感。\n*   **动作:** 静态，身体微微向右倾斜。\n*   **镜头:** 静态固定机位，模拟广角镜头的轻微畸变感。\n*   **光效:** 整体柔光，环境光均匀。\n*   **声音:** 店铺内的轻微环境音，远处人声。\n\n#### [KF02 | 2.0s | LS (Long Shot) / 全身全景]\n*   **画面:** 镜头稍微推近。女主坐姿更加清晰，能看到她的鞋子（黑色乐福）和袜子。豹纹包在右侧，条纹衬衫在腿上自然垂落。\n*   **动作:** 她轻轻调整了一下包带，或者用手拨弄了一下垂在腿上的衬衫下摆。\n*   **镜头:** 缓慢的推镜头 (Slow Dolly In)。\n*   **光效:** 阳光感增强，照亮腿部线条。\n\n#### [KF03 | 2.5s | MS (Medium Shot) / 中景]\n*   **画面:** 腰部以上入画。焦点集中在T恤的做旧领口细节和耳环。\n*   **动作:** 她正在整理头发，将一缕长发别到耳后，露出耳朵上的大圆环。\n*   **镜头:** 侧拍或四分之三侧面，轻微的横向平移。\n*   **景深:** 背景挂画略微虚化，人物清晰。\n*   **光效:** 轮廓光（Rim Light）勾勒出发丝。\n\n#### [KF04 | 2.5s | MCU (Medium Close-Up) / 中近景]\n*   **画面:** 胸部以上。女主已经整理好发型，双手拿着手机（或手机壳），准备自拍。\n*   **动作:** 她看着屏幕（画面外），嘴角开始上扬，眼神从专注转为惊喜。\n*   **镜头:** 正面平视，模拟手机前置摄像头视角的轻微广角。\n*   **光效:** 面部受光均匀。\n\n#### [KF05 | 2.0s | CU (Close-Up) / 面部特写]\n*   **画面:** 面部特写。\n*   **动作:** 笑容完全绽放，眼睛弯成月牙，展现出极具感染力的快乐。\n*   **镜头:** 镜头缓慢推进 (Crash Zoom) 或 缓慢前移。\n*   **光效:** 眼神光清晰可见，皮肤质感细腻。\n*   **声音:** 快门声 (模拟) 或 笑声。\n\n#### [KF06 | 2.0s | ECU (Extreme Close-Up) / 极近特写 - 眼睛]\n*   **画面:** 特写眼睛区域，几乎占据整个画面。\n*   **动作:** 眼神直视观众（或镜头），流露出自信与俏皮。\n*   **镜头:** 极浅景深，背景完全融化成光斑。\n*   **光效:** 强烈的眼神光，强调瞳孔细节。\n*   **声音:** 音乐高潮点，心跳声。\n\n#### [KF07 | 2.0s | Insert (插入镜头) - 手部与包]\n*   **画面:** 局部特写。一只手握着包带，豹纹图案清晰，手指修长。\n*   **动作:** 手轻轻晃动了一下包带，或者手指在包带上摩挲。\n*   **镜头:** 俯拍或侧拍特写。\n*   **光效:** 聚焦在豹纹图案和皮肤纹理上。\n*   **声音:** 布料摩擦声。\n\n#### [KF08 | 2.5s | Low Angle (低角度) - 腿部与鞋]\n*   **画面:** 从下往上拍。\n*   **动作:** 女主调整了一下坐姿，双腿伸直或交叉，展示白色袜子和黑色乐福鞋。\n*   **镜头:** 仰拍，利用砖墙的底部线条作为引导。\n*   **光效:** 地面反光，营造时尚感。\n*   **声音:** 脚步调整的声音。\n\n#### [KF09 | 2.0s | MLS (Medium Long Shot) / 中全景 - 最终定格]\n*   **画面:** 回到类似KF02的中全景，但人物姿态更自信。\n*   **动作:** 她放下手机，双手抱胸或托腮，对着镜头比出一个“V”字或者挥手，定格结束。\n*   **镜头:** 缓慢拉远 (Slow Pull Back)，画面定格。\n*   **光效:** 整体画面明亮、温暖。\n*   **声音:** 音乐渐弱，画面黑场。\n\n---\n\n### E) 分镜图 (Master Contact Sheet)\n\n*(注：由于AI无法直接生成图像，以下是为您生成的符合要求的图像提示词。您可以将下方的Prompt输入到 Midjourney, Stable Diffusion 等工具中，即可生成包含9个分镜的完整接片图。)*\n\n**System Prompt (for AI Image Generator):**\n> Commercial storyboard grid, 3x3 layout. No text on images. Photorealistic, cinematic lighting.\n> **Style:** Korean fashion aesthetic, soft natural lighting, film grain, consistent color grading (warm tones, soft shadows).\n> **Subject:** A young woman with long black hair, wearing a white distressed graphic tee, beige striped shirt over legs, white socks, black loafers, large gold hoop earrings, and a leopard print tote bag.\n> **Setting:** Interior with red brick wall on the left and white paneling with fashion photos on the right.\n\n**Image Generation Prompt:**\n> [1] A cinematic storyboard shot, Wide Shot of a young woman sitting on a black bench against a red brick wall and white wall with fashion photos. She is relaxed, legs crossed, leopard print bag on shoulder.\n> [2] Medium Shot, she is adjusting the beige striped shirt on her legs, looking happy.\n> [3] Medium Close-Up, she is fixing her hair behind her ear, showing"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 601, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 405, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "b6bb4a3055adc718ec98befee233f8b05c778465", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [803.2073364257812, 808.9767456054688], "pos": [691.8848876953125, 12317.7060546875], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 651, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 431, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [607], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}, {"name": "LIST", "label": "LIST", "type": "LIST", "localized_name": "LIST"}], "size": [270.9519958496094, 102], "pos": [-96.7901611328125, 12175.2216796875], "widgets_values": ["false", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "text0", "link": 596, "label": "text0", "type": "TEXT,STRING", "localized_name": "text0"}, {"name": "text1", "link": 597, "label": "text1", "type": "TEXT,STRING", "localized_name": "text1"}, {"widget": {"name": "linebreak_addition"}, "name": "linebreak_addition", "label": "linebreak_addition", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "linebreak_addition"}, {"widget": {"name": "delimiter"}, "shape": 7, "name": "delimiter", "label": "delimiter", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "delimiter"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 402, "type": "MultiTextConcatenate", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MultiTextConcatenate"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [646], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [310.515869140625, 93.38060760498047], "pos": [-126.78370666503906, 12175.095703125], "widgets_values": ["You are an award-winning trailer director + cinematographer + storyboard artist.\nYour craft standard: COMMERCIAL MASTER-LEVEL. Every story beat must be emotionally precise, universally legible, and brand-safe. Every keyframe must be portfolio-grade, technically flawless, and indistinguishable from a high-budget commercial production's pre-viz board.\nYour job: turn ONE reference image into a cohesive cinematic short sequence, then output AI-video-ready keyframes.\n\nUser provides: one reference image (image).\n\nComposition Analysis: First, analyze the full composition: identify ALL key subjects (person/group/vehicle/object/animal/props/environment elements) and describe spatial relationships and interactions (left/right/foreground/background, facing direction, what each is doing).\nTruthfulness: Do NOT guess real identities, exact real-world locations, or brand ownership. Stick to visible facts. Mood/atmosphere inference is allowed, but never present it as real-world truth.\nStrict Continuity: Maintain strict continuity across ALL shots: same subjects, same wardrobe/appearance, same environment, same time-of-day and lighting style. Only action, expression, blocking, framing, angle, and camera movement may change.\nDepth of Field: Must be realistic: deeper in wides, shallower in close-ups with natural bokeh.\nColor Grade: Keep ONE consistent cinematic color grade across the entire sequence.\nNo New Elements: Do NOT introduce new characters/objects not present in the reference image. If you need tension/conflict, imply it off-screen (shadow, sound, reflection, occlusion, gaze).\n\nExpand the image into a 10–20 second cinematic clip with a clear theme and emotional progression (setup → build → turn → payoff). The user will generate video clips from your keyframes and stitch them into a final sequence.\n\nOutput (with clear subheadings):\nSubjects: List each key subject (A/B/C…), describe visible traits (wardrobe/material/form), relative positions, facing direction, action/state, and any interaction.\nEnvironment & Lighting: Interior/exterior, spatial layout, background elements, ground/walls/materials, light direction & quality (hard/soft; key/fill/rim), implied time-of-day, 3–8 vibe keywords.\nVisual Anchors: List 3–6 visual traits that must stay constant across all shots (palette, signature prop, key light source, weather/fog/rain, grain/texture, background markers).\n\nFrom the image, propose:\nTheme: One sentence.\nLogline: One restrained trailer-style sentence grounded in what the image can support.\nEmotional Arc: 4 beats (setup/build/turn/payoff), one line each.\nStory quality: The story must have a universal emotional core accessible across cultures. Every beat must earn its place with dramatic economy - if a beat does not advance emotion or tension, cut it. Imply meaning through visual composition and gaze (subtext over exposition). The emotional arc must feel premium, aspirational, and emotionally intelligent (brand-safe). The entire sequence must orbit ONE single piercing emotional truth, not a vague mix of moods.\n\nChoose and explain your filmmaking approach (must include):\nShot progression strategy: How you move from wide to close (or reverse) to serve the beats.\nCamera movement plan: Push/pull/pan/dolly/track/orbit/handheld micro-shake/gimbal—and WHY.\nLens & exposure suggestions: Focal length range (18/24/35/50/85mm etc.), DoF tendency (shallow/medium/deep), shutter \"feel\" (cinematic vs documentary).\nLight & color: Contrast, key tones, material rendering priorities, optional grain (must match the reference style).\n\nOutput a Keyframe List: default 9–12 frames (later assembled into ONE master grid). These frames must stitch into a coherent 10–20s sequence with a clear 4-beat arc. Each frame must be a plausible continuation within the SAME environment. Each keyframe must be compositionally strong enough to stand alone as a single still image, technically precise (realistic DoF, plausible lighting, accurate shadows, coherent perspective), and emotionally charged (the viewer should feel something from each frame even without context).\n\nUse this exact format per frame:\n[KF# | suggested duration (sec) | shot type (ELS/LS/MLS/MS/MCU/CU/ECU/Low/Worm's-eye/High/Bird's-eye/Insert)]\nComposition: Subject placement, foreground/mid/background, leading lines, gaze direction.\nAction/beat: What visibly happens (simple, executable).\nCamera: Height, angle, movement (e.g., slow 5% push-in / 1m lateral move / subtle handheld).\nLens/DoF: Focal length (mm), DoF (shallow/medium/deep), focus target.\nLighting & grade: Keep consistent; call out highlight/shadow emphasis.\nSound/atmos (optional): One line (wind, city hum, footsteps, metal creak) to support editing rhythm.\n\nHard requirements:\nMust include: 1 environment-establishing wide, 1 intimate close-up, 1 extreme detail ECU, and 1 power-angle shot (low or high).\nEnsure edit-motivated continuity between shots (eyeline match, action continuation, consistent screen direction / axis).\nCommercial master-level gate: Before finalizing, review - Does the story have ONE clear emotional core (not a vague mood)? Does every frame justify its existence (if you can cut it without losing coherence, it is redundant - replace or remove it)? Does each keyframe have compositional intentionality (not default center-framing or generic coverage)? Is visual quality consistent with the reference image fidelity and style?\n\nIf the reference image lacks sufficient narrative elements, output a shorter sequence (minimum 4 keyframes covering the 4-beat arc), state what additional context would enable expansion, do NOT fabricate subjects or props. Quality standard remains unchanged in fallback mode.\n\nYou MUST additionally output ONE single master image: a Cinematic Contact Sheet / Storyboard Grid containing ALL keyframes in one large image.\nGrid Layout: Default 3x3. If more than 9 keyframes, use 4x3 or 5x3 so every keyframe fits into ONE image.\nContent: The single master image must include every keyframe as a separate panel (one shot per cell) for easy selection.\nLabeling: Each panel must be clearly labeled: KF number + shot type + suggested duration (labels placed in safe margins, never covering the subject).\nContinuity: Strict continuity across ALL panels: same subjects, same wardrobe/appearance, same environment, same lighting & same cinematic color grade; only action/expression/blocking/framing/movement changes.\nRealism: DoF shifts realistically: shallow in close-ups, deeper in wides; photoreal textures and consistent grading.\nStyle match: The grid overall visual quality, color treatment, and texture must closely match the reference image.\nFollow-up: After the master grid image, output the full text breakdown for each KF in order so the user can regenerate any single frame at higher quality.\n\nOutput in this order:\nA) Scene Breakdown\nB) Theme & Story\nC) Cinematic Approach\nD) Keyframes (KF# list)\nE) ONE Master Contact Sheet Image (All KFs in one grid)\n\n分镜上不要有文字\n分镜图片风格要与原图保持一致\n\n用中文输出\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 433, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "concat", "links": [606], "label": "联结字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "concat"}], "size": [400, 220], "pos": [-133.465087890625, 12174.66796875], "widgets_values": ["", "", "", ","], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text1"}, "name": "text1", "link": 614, "label": "text1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "text2"}, "name": "text2", "link": 615, "label": "text2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本_2"}, {"widget": {"name": "text3"}, "name": "text3", "link": 646, "labe